Aim

To identify suitable keywords for a food delivery website using Google Keyword Planner.

Beginner Level Exact Steps
Step 1: Open Browser

Open Google Chrome.

Step 2: Open Google Ads Website

Go to:

Google Ads Official Website

Step 3: Sign In with Gmail
Click Sign In
Enter your Gmail ID
Enter password
Login successfully
Step 4: Create Google Ads Account

If asking:

Click New Google Ads Account
Select Switch to Expert Mode
Click Create account without campaign
Step 5: Open Keyword Planner
In top menu click Tools
Under Planning
Click Keyword Planner
Step 6: Select “Discover New Keywords”

Click:

Discover New Keywords

Step 7: Enter Food Delivery Keywords

Type sample keywords like:

food delivery
online food order
pizza delivery
restaurant near me

Then click:

Get Results

Step 8: Analyze Keywords

Now Google shows:

Average monthly searches
Competition
Bid amount

Observe keywords with:

High searches
Medium or low competition
Step 9: Select Important Keywords

Choose some keywords.

Example Keywords
Keyword	Monthly Searches
Online food delivery	High
Pizza delivery near me	Medium
Fast food online	High
Home food delivery	Medium
Order food online	High
Step 10: Download Keyword List
Click Download Keyword Ideas
Save as Excel or CSV file
Step 11: Save Screenshots

Take screenshots of:

Keyword Planner page
Search results
Selected keywords

(Useful for record submission)
